# NOTE: proposal.ipynb is committed WITH its outputs once it has been run.
# The course requires a rendered notebook, so do not strip outputs
# (no nbstripout, no --ClearOutputPreprocessor).
# outputs/split.csv is the one generated file we force-add, because the
# train/val/test assignment must stay frozen across the proposal and the
# final report. Add it with:  git add -f outputs/split.csv
